{
  "uid": "homelab-caidas",
  "title": "homelab-01: caídas y salud",
  "description": "Por qué se cae homelab-01: causa de cada arranque, cortes de red, temperatura, watchdog. Datos de vigia-metricas (rol vigia_red).",
  "tags": [
    "homelab",
    "caidas",
    "vigia"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Arranques",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "expr": "changes(node_boot_time_seconds[2m]) > 0",
        "step": "60s",
        "titleFormat": "Arranque",
        "textFormat": "El servidor arrancó"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cómo leer este tablero",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Arriba:** el estado ahora (todo verde = sano). **Medio:** temperatura y carga; las líneas verticales marcan cada arranque. **Abajo:** el historial de los últimos 20 días: cada arranque con su causa y cada corte de red con su duración.\n\nCausas posibles de un arranque: *de golpe* = luz, fuente o cuelgue (sin UPS); *vigía* = estuvo mucho sin WiFi y el vigía lo reinició (mudanza o router apagado); *botón*; *watchdog* = se colgó y se reinició solo; *actualización*. Informe completo: `docs/` y `~/Documents/informes-homelab/`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Encendido hace",
      "description": "Tiempo desde el último arranque.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 3600
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "node_time_seconds - node_boot_time_seconds"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Red (router)",
      "description": "¿El router responde ahora? Lo mide vigia-metricas cada minuto.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "SIN RED",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "homelab_red_ok"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Temperatura CPU",
      "description": "Núcleo más caliente. 100 °C es el límite crítico del i5-4460.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "celsius",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 75
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 88
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "max(node_hwmon_temp_celsius{chip=\"platform_coretemp_0\"})"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
